.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-UNINSTALL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-uninstall
.Nd remove the NOMAD stack, agents, and secrets
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad uninstall
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad uninstall
removes Project NOMAD from this Mac. After a confirmation prompt it removes all
.Sy nomad_*
containers and named volumes, the Ollama LaunchAgent and its plist, and the
secrets file.
.Pp
The data on the data drive (databases, Ollama models, stored content) is
removed only if you confirm that step separately, so you can uninstall the
stack while keeping your downloaded models and content. Homebrew, OrbStack, and
Ollama are user-level installs that other apps may depend on, so they are left
in place.
.Pp
Use this to cleanly remove NOMAD. If you intend to reinstall immediately,
.Xr nomad-reinstall 1
combines the wipe and a fresh install behind a single confirmation.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad uninstall
Remove containers, the LaunchAgent, and secrets; you are asked separately
whether to also erase the data drive.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-install 1 ,
.Xr nomad-reinstall 1
